OL,3,GNEWSAFootball match marks birthday of  
OL,4,Ababy who died                          
OL,6,FA charity football match has been      
OL,7,Fplayed to mark what would have been the
OL,8,Ffifth birthday of a baby who died of a 
OL,9,Frare condition at six months old.      
OL,11,FRupert Wood was born with pyruvate     
OL,12,Fdehydrogenase deficiency, a rare       
OL,13,Finherited condition that means a body  
OL,14,Fcannot process carbohydrates into      
OL,15,Fenergy, according to the NHS.          
OL,17,FHis parents, David and Joanna Wood,    
OL,18,Ffrom Ashford in Kent, organised the    
OL,19,Fmatch in support of children's hospice 
OL,20,FDemelza, which helped them during      
OL,21,FRupert's life.                         
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
